WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:47.529
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:47.799 --> 00:48.159
Cao Jun.

3
00:48.159 --> 00:49.079
What are you up to, Jun?

4
00:49.640 --> 00:50.240
What's going on?

5
00:50.280 --> 00:51.079
Oh, it's nothing.

6
00:51.079 --> 00:52.079
I'm... I'm washing the vegetables.

7
00:52.439 --> 00:53.920
Hurry up and wrap these dumplings.

8
00:53.920 --> 00:54.759
*Hold My Hand* is about to start.

9
00:54.759 --> 00:55.399
I'm going inside to watch it.

10
00:55.399 --> 00:56.320
All right, okay.

11
01:00.159 --> 01:01.759
I heard Cao Jun's wife came back.

12
01:01.880 --> 01:03.079
Haven't they been divorced for years?

13
01:03.399 --> 01:05.239
The guy she was with later sold fake medicine.

14
01:05.239 --> 01:06.159
He ended up getting arrested.

15
01:06.159 --> 01:08.079
Now she's back and insists on staying here.

16
01:08.560 --> 01:09.239
Tell me,

17
01:09.719 --> 01:11.319
isn't that taking advantage of an honest guy?

18
01:11.879 --> 01:12.480
Can you believe that?

19
03:04.159 --> 03:05.479
Leaving whenever they want,

20
03:06.560 --> 03:08.599
coming back whenever they want.

21
03:10.800 --> 03:11.960
Every single one of them.

22
03:12.080 --> 03:13.560
How can they be so shameless?

23
03:13.639 --> 03:14.919
So damn unreliable.

24
03:49.919 --> 03:52.800
Drifting toward me, I listen closely.

25
03:53.919 --> 03:55.000
What's wrong, girl?

26
03:58.639 --> 03:59.680
Are you crying?

27
04:00.319 --> 04:01.680
Why so unhappy?

28
04:01.840 --> 04:02.560
What?

29
04:03.960 --> 04:05.000
You're happy, huh?

30
04:05.680 --> 04:06.800
What's there to be sad about?

31
04:07.319 --> 04:08.199
Talk to me. Come on.

32
04:12.120 --> 04:12.879
Have some sunflower seeds.

33
04:13.080 --> 04:13.560
Come on, here.

34
04:13.680 --> 04:14.159
Got some right here.

35
04:14.199 --> 04:14.680
Wait.

36
04:15.960 --> 04:16.959
Don't, don't spill them.

37
04:17.600 --> 04:18.279
Have some. Eat up.

38
04:19.000 --> 04:19.759
They're so good.

39
04:20.439 --> 04:21.480
Sunflower seeds will cheer you right up.

40
04:25.759 --> 04:27.079
Watch where you're spitting!

41
04:36.120 --> 04:37.920
Five champions!

42
04:38.480 --> 04:39.199
You dummy.

43
04:40.560 --> 04:41.319
Can you do it?

44
04:43.120 --> 04:44.439
I've got sixes!

45
04:45.399 --> 04:46.600
Sixes work too.

46
04:47.199 --> 04:47.639
Can you do it?

47
04:49.000 --> 04:49.920
You're so silly.

48
04:49.920 --> 04:50.639
Eight Horses!

49
04:51.040 --> 04:51.519
Beats yours!

50
04:51.720 --> 04:52.360
Eight Horses!

51
04:53.959 --> 04:54.600
Eight Horses!

52
04:55.120 --> 04:55.800
Eight Horses works too.

53
04:56.199 --> 04:56.560
How's that?

54
04:59.959 --> 05:01.160
Bang, you're dead.

55
05:01.439 --> 05:02.199
Hitting me now?

56
05:02.560 --> 05:03.519
I'll hit you!

57
05:03.519 --> 05:04.079
So what?

58
05:04.160 --> 05:05.240
Fine, you can hit me later.

59
05:05.759 --> 05:06.639
Hey, um...

60
05:07.759 --> 05:08.560
It's too cold out here.

61
05:09.279 --> 05:09.839
Let's go.

62
05:11.120 --> 05:11.879
Where to?

63
05:12.160 --> 05:13.319
Go grab a drink, obviously.

64
05:15.560 --> 05:16.480
What is there to think about?

65
05:16.480 --> 05:16.879
Let's go.

66
05:17.040 --> 05:17.920
Let's go have a drink.

67
05:18.600 --> 05:19.040
Alright, alright, alright.

68
05:19.079 --> 05:19.480
Let's go.

69
05:28.800 --> 05:29.519
Tu Chunyan.

70
05:36.040 --> 05:36.759
Tu Chunyan.

71
05:39.480 --> 05:40.199
Tu Chunyan.

72
05:56.800 --> 05:58.040
Who on earth

73
05:58.560 --> 05:59.680
wants to kill Qian Yichuan?

74
06:04.120 --> 06:05.439
Look at your slight build.

75
06:05.439 --> 06:06.800
Carrying such heavy gear every day.

76
06:06.800 --> 06:08.040
How about I film for you?

77
06:08.319 --> 06:08.920
Teach me.

78
06:09.279 --> 06:10.279
Why do you want to learn this?

79
06:11.560 --> 06:11.959
How about this:

80
06:12.360 --> 06:13.839
Fi-film me instead.

81
06:14.319 --> 06:14.839
What do you say?

82
06:15.040 --> 06:15.920
I... I want to...

83
06:16.360 --> 06:17.800
say a few words today.

84
06:18.279 --> 06:19.000
Speak my mind.

85
06:19.600 --> 06:20.040
All right.

86
06:25.160 --> 06:26.120
Let me say a few words.

87
06:29.319 --> 06:30.360
What are you filming here?

88
06:31.120 --> 06:31.959
Put that thing away.

89
06:32.399 --> 06:33.000
Leizi.

90
06:33.920 --> 06:34.519
Who's he?

91
06:35.120 --> 06:36.160
He's related to the factory director.

92
06:38.480 --> 06:39.279
Don't you understand me?

93
06:39.319 --> 06:39.879
I'll smash it to pieces!

94
06:40.360 --> 06:40.759
Leizi, Leizi, Leizi!

95
06:40.759 --> 06:41.720
Why can't I film?

96
06:41.759 --> 06:42.279
Leizi, Leizi!

97
06:42.319 --> 06:43.160
She's a TV reporter.

98
06:43.199 --> 06:43.720
Zhao Haipeng,

99
06:43.800 --> 06:44.800
this has nothing to do with you!

100
06:44.839 --> 06:45.560
No, listen to me...

101
06:45.720 --> 06:46.720
Listen to you? I...

102
06:46.720 --> 06:47.720
Listen to you? Beat him up, Leizi!

103
06:47.720 --> 06:48.360
Smash it!

104
06:50.240 --> 06:50.759
What are you doing?!

105
06:50.759 --> 06:51.199
Smash it!

106
06:51.199 --> 06:51.920
Over here, smash it!

107
06:58.240 --> 06:58.639
Give it to me!

108
06:58.639 --> 06:59.079
Still fighting back?

109
06:59.079 --> 06:59.600
Give it to me!

110
07:07.720 --> 07:09.120
Get him, all of you!

111
07:19.839 --> 07:20.279
After him!

112
07:20.279 --> 07:20.959
Get him!

113
07:22.079 --> 07:22.720
Catch him!

114
07:23.279 --> 07:23.920
Catch who?

115
07:23.920 --> 07:24.439
Him!

116
07:25.360 --> 07:25.959
Grab him!

117
07:27.879 --> 07:28.480
Get him!

118
07:29.720 --> 07:30.360
Bro! Bro!

119
07:30.360 --> 07:30.800
Hold him!

120
07:31.120 --> 07:32.279
Why'd you hit my face?

121
07:32.279 --> 07:33.160
Don't run!

122
07:42.000 --> 07:43.040
Over here! Over here!

123
07:44.879 --> 07:45.439
Tieping!

124
07:46.319 --> 07:46.879
Stop filming!

125
07:47.079 --> 07:47.839
Go get backup!

126
07:49.560 --> 07:50.279
Hurry and call someone!

127
07:50.920 --> 07:51.920
Find Cheng Youtian!

128
08:05.639 --> 08:06.560
You dare hit me?!

129
08:08.319 --> 08:08.959
Hit me, huh?!

130
08:11.680 --> 08:12.439
Stay out of this!

131
08:12.439 --> 08:13.199
What are you doing?!

132
08:13.360 --> 08:13.959
Stay back!

133
08:15.480 --> 08:15.920
Careful!

134
08:16.399 --> 08:16.959
Boys!

135
08:17.959 --> 08:18.560
Grab him!

136
08:19.120 --> 08:19.839
Hold him down!

137
08:23.759 --> 08:24.519
Beat him up!

138
08:24.519 --> 08:25.720
Beat him! Are you okay?

139
08:25.759 --> 08:26.120
I'm fine.

140
08:26.959 --> 08:27.639
Beat him up!

141
08:28.120 --> 08:29.120
His head is injured!

142
08:29.120 --> 08:30.120
Beat him up!

143
08:30.439 --> 08:31.279
Beat the hell out of him!

144
08:32.360 --> 08:33.360
His head is injured!

145
08:35.240 --> 08:36.440
Tieping, are you okay?

146
08:36.639 --> 08:37.279
Hurry up!

147
08:38.320 --> 08:38.960
Director!

148
08:42.480 --> 08:43.080
Are you okay?

149
08:43.360 --> 08:43.960
Hang in there!

150
08:45.679 --> 08:46.840
Haipeng, are you okay?

151
08:46.840 --> 08:47.399
I'm fine.

152
08:48.200 --> 08:49.600
Come on, to the clinic!

153
08:49.679 --> 08:50.320
Go to the clinic!

154
08:51.039 --> 08:51.440
Let's go!

155
08:51.840 --> 08:52.639
Move!

156
08:52.759 --> 08:54.039
Move, move!

157
08:54.399 --> 08:55.039
Let's go!

158
09:21.639 --> 09:22.240
Let's talk inside.

159
09:29.320 --> 09:30.240
Qian Yichuan is dead.

160
09:31.720 --> 09:33.120
Tu Chunyan's fate is unknown.

161
09:33.879 --> 09:34.519
And apparently,

162
09:35.039 --> 09:36.120
there was a cop too?

163
09:36.639 --> 09:37.279
Critically injured.

164
09:38.240 --> 09:38.879
I know.

165
09:40.200 --> 09:41.039
I was there.

166
09:41.519 --> 09:42.799
You were there?

167
09:43.639 --> 09:44.720
It's an ongoing case,

168
09:45.120 --> 09:46.039
the police won't let me talk.

169
09:46.440 --> 09:47.320
You're right.

170
09:47.320 --> 09:48.759
Death is getting closer to us.

171
09:50.080 --> 09:51.120
Who knows which day,

172
09:51.639 --> 09:52.399
which one of us,

173
09:53.440 --> 09:54.360
will suddenly just be gone.

174
10:06.120 --> 10:06.679
Leshui,

175
10:08.799 --> 10:09.480
I'm begging you.

176
10:10.879 --> 10:11.960
Get out of here right now.

177
10:14.279 --> 10:15.360
Take your mom with you.

178
10:16.200 --> 10:17.399
Better take Lili along too.

179
10:17.960 --> 10:19.399
I'm terrified if the killer comes knocking...

180
10:19.399 --> 10:20.120
It's... it's...

181
10:20.639 --> 10:21.159
There's just...

182
10:21.159 --> 10:22.240
no way to guard against it!

183
10:23.840 --> 10:24.600
Who do you think

184
10:25.759 --> 10:26.799
the killer is?

185
10:32.639 --> 10:33.600
How would I know?

186
10:39.720 --> 10:40.559
That's the third one.

187
10:41.919 --> 10:43.559
The killer is declaring war on us.

188
10:44.240 --> 10:45.120
Three lives lost.

189
10:45.720 --> 10:46.639
This is a major case, everyone.

190
10:47.320 --> 10:48.480
The provincial leaders take this very seriously.

191
10:49.080 --> 10:50.080
The municipal bureau set up a task force.

192
10:50.600 --> 10:51.559
Our specific task

193
10:51.960 --> 10:53.559
is to summarize last night's situation,

194
10:53.799 --> 10:55.759
connect and analyze all three murders,

195
10:56.120 --> 10:56.720
and investigate them as a linked series.

196
10:58.039 --> 10:58.559
Gao,

197
10:59.360 --> 11:00.559
tell us about last night.

198
11:00.879 --> 11:03.720
Yesterday's crime scene was at the old factory area.

199
11:04.399 --> 11:05.519
There are no surveillance cameras there,

200
11:05.519 --> 11:07.519
but we recovered footprints at the scene.

201
11:07.960 --> 11:08.960
Besides Chuang's,

202
11:09.159 --> 11:10.000
Tu Chunyan's,

203
11:10.200 --> 11:11.080
and Qian Yichuan's,

204
11:11.159 --> 11:12.519
there's an unidentified one.

205
11:13.480 --> 11:14.480
These footprints,

206
11:14.919 --> 11:15.879
after our examination,

207
11:15.879 --> 11:17.759
belong to Feiyun-brand snow boots.

208
11:18.080 --> 11:19.159
The shoe size is 45.

209
11:19.480 --> 11:20.399
Wu, how tall are you?

210
11:21.519 --> 11:22.120
189 cm.

211
11:22.759 --> 11:23.720
What size shoe do you wear?

212
11:24.039 --> 11:24.720
Size 45.

213
11:24.960 --> 11:25.600
Size 45.

214
11:26.240 --> 11:27.200
So right now,

215
11:27.200 --> 11:29.639
we estimate the person who left these prints

216
11:29.639 --> 11:31.759
is around 185 to 195 cm tall,

217
11:32.120 --> 11:33.840
and weighs over 95 kg.

218
11:35.120 --> 11:37.080
His footprints lead from the malt silo

219
11:37.120 --> 11:39.320
all the way to the highway, where they vanish.

220
11:39.919 --> 11:41.759
The second lead is a video taken by

221
11:41.919 --> 11:43.720
reporter Shen Leshui at the crime scene.

222
11:44.000 --> 11:44.720
Take a look, everyone.

223
11:47.960 --> 11:49.840
From this video, we can see

224
11:50.240 --> 11:51.799
the person seen from behind

225
11:52.200 --> 11:52.879
is very agile.

226
11:53.240 --> 11:54.240
It's a male,

227
11:54.399 --> 11:56.080
who definitely works out.

228
11:56.480 --> 11:58.679
Moreover, the footprints where it was filmed

229
11:59.080 --> 12:01.440
match the footprints found at the crime scene.

230
12:02.159 --> 12:03.600
So we can preliminarily determine

231
12:03.720 --> 12:05.320
that the person in this video is the killer.

232
12:05.720 --> 12:07.080
Another piece of information is,

233
12:07.200 --> 12:08.039
from what we know,

234
12:08.039 --> 12:10.120
no one has visited

235
12:10.120 --> 12:11.080
this abandoned factory for a long time.

236
12:11.320 --> 12:13.279
It's usually kept locked,

237
12:13.559 --> 12:15.279
and the key was with Qian Yichuan.

238
12:15.559 --> 12:17.039
For him to run from the malt silo

239
12:17.480 --> 12:19.759
to the highway so quickly

240
12:20.240 --> 12:22.919
proves he's extremely familiar with the area.

241
12:23.559 --> 12:24.720
So my suggestion is

242
12:24.799 --> 12:27.960
we prioritize screening male brewery employees.

243
12:28.200 --> 12:30.000
Anyone matching the criteria I just mentioned

244
12:30.039 --> 12:31.240
should be our primary focus.

245
12:31.960 --> 12:33.360
When we found the bodies

246
12:33.519 --> 12:34.600
of Ma Guowen and Cao Jun,

247
12:35.399 --> 12:36.200
both of their heads

248
12:36.600 --> 12:38.679
were covered with identical black plastic bags.

249
12:39.360 --> 12:41.000
And Qian Yichuan, who fell to his death,

250
12:41.320 --> 12:41.840
was the same.

251
12:42.759 --> 12:43.279
Meanwhile,

252
12:43.720 --> 12:44.679
beside them,

253
12:45.200 --> 12:46.000
we also discovered

254
12:46.200 --> 12:47.080
identical

255
12:47.639 --> 12:49.000
bottle caps from Lapi Brewery.

256
12:50.080 --> 12:51.200
That can't be a coincidence.

257
12:54.120 --> 12:55.919
The victims didn't lose any valuables.

258
12:56.559 --> 12:57.399
On the surface,

259
12:57.759 --> 12:59.480
we can basically rule out murder for money.

260
13:00.320 --> 13:01.720
That makes the likelihood of revenge killing

261
13:02.159 --> 13:02.919
all the more apparent.

262
13:03.440 --> 13:04.960
Analyzing the evidence collected from the scene

263
13:05.559 --> 13:07.240
and the circumstances of the three victims,

264
13:07.759 --> 13:08.519
I personally think

265
13:09.159 --> 13:10.879
we can't rule out a serial killer.

266
13:12.159 --> 13:14.039
Based on our current findings

267
13:14.559 --> 13:15.360
and the preliminary assessment

268
13:15.679 --> 13:16.639
from forensics,

269
13:17.200 --> 13:18.320
before we get further leads

270
13:18.600 --> 13:19.440
and evidence,

271
13:20.120 --> 13:21.080
our priority

272
13:21.639 --> 13:22.759
is to thoroughly investigate

273
13:23.000 --> 13:24.799
all social connections tied to the three victims.

274
13:25.720 --> 13:26.440
Let me emphasize one thing:

275
13:26.720 --> 13:27.440
be thorough.

276
13:28.320 --> 13:29.679
Don't let a single clue slip through the cracks.

277
13:39.919 --> 13:40.519
You're here.

278
13:40.879 --> 13:41.559
Master, you're here.

279
13:42.000 --> 13:42.639
Lock the door.

280
13:42.879 --> 13:43.399
Locked.

281
13:43.559 --> 13:44.000
It's locked.

282
13:44.480 --> 13:44.840
Quick.

283
13:45.639 --> 13:46.159
Come inside.

284
13:46.399 --> 13:46.960
Hurry, hurry.

285
13:52.559 --> 13:53.440
Sit down, sit down.

286
14:00.000 --> 14:00.960
Everyone's here.

287
14:01.960 --> 14:03.759
Of course we are. We're all that's left.

288
14:06.519 --> 14:07.879
I wonder if Xiao Tu has woken up yet.

289
14:09.320 --> 14:10.080
No idea.

290
14:10.120 --> 14:11.639
I texted her, but she didn't reply.

291
14:12.360 --> 14:13.039
I did too.

292
14:13.440 --> 14:14.399
She didn't reply to me either.

293
14:16.080 --> 14:17.120
I just hope Xiao Tu...

294
14:17.320 --> 14:18.519
...can pull through this.

295
14:19.519 --> 14:21.440
She was with Qian Yichuan for so many years,

296
14:21.600 --> 14:22.399
through thick and thin.

297
14:23.200 --> 14:25.320
She won't be able to take this.

298
14:25.440 --> 14:25.960
Yeah.

299
14:26.600 --> 14:28.320
So even if she wakes up,

300
14:29.919 --> 14:31.639
there's another hurdle waiting for her.

301
14:33.600 --> 14:34.519
This morning,

302
14:35.360 --> 14:36.919
Tieping and I went to bring her chicken soup.

303
14:37.519 --> 14:38.519
The police guarded the door.

304
14:39.120 --> 14:39.960
They wouldn't let anyone in.

305
14:40.440 --> 14:41.200
Well, of course.

306
14:44.080 --> 14:45.600
We used to have a whole room of people,

307
14:46.480 --> 14:48.000
and now only a few of us are left.

308
14:48.320 --> 14:49.759
May good people stay safe and sound.

309
14:50.440 --> 14:51.639
Cao Jun was a good man, right?

310
14:52.759 --> 14:54.240
And Qian Yichuan wasn't that bad either, was he?

311
14:55.200 --> 14:55.960
Xiao Tu included.

312
14:56.399 --> 14:57.279
What did she ever do to anyone?

313
14:58.120 --> 14:58.799
Hold on, hold on.

314
14:59.200 --> 14:59.960
Today, we...

315
15:00.399 --> 15:00.960
Yeah?

316
15:01.159 --> 15:02.799
...didn't come here to talk about who's good.

317
15:03.039 --> 15:05.120
Aren't we here to figure out who the bad guy is?

318
15:08.480 --> 15:09.159
Who? Tieping?

319
15:10.679 --> 15:11.720
You rarely speak up.

320
15:11.759 --> 15:12.559
Say something.

321
15:13.399 --> 15:15.120
Tieping isn't good with words.

322
15:15.240 --> 15:16.480
Just let him speak.

323
15:16.639 --> 15:17.279
Right.

324
15:17.360 --> 15:18.919
No, he never talks anyway.

325
15:19.240 --> 15:19.639
Come on,

326
15:19.679 --> 15:21.159
just let him say what he feels.

327
15:21.159 --> 15:22.480
He doesn't like talking.

328
15:23.039 --> 15:23.720
Do you have any thoughts?

329
15:24.440 --> 15:25.000
He doesn't—

330
15:25.000 --> 15:25.399
Just—

331
15:28.399 --> 15:29.080
Someone's coming.

332
15:29.440 --> 15:29.919
Hide!

333
15:30.559 --> 15:31.039
Get in the kitchen!

334
15:35.960 --> 15:36.399
Tieping!

335
15:37.759 --> 15:38.440
Get in there, quick!

336
15:39.879 --> 15:40.720
Don't move. Stay still!

337
15:59.159 --> 15:59.720
Director Cheng,

338
16:00.159 --> 16:02.240
I went to the old plant to find Qian Yichuan yesterday

339
16:02.559 --> 16:03.600
and got footage of someone from behind.

340
16:04.720 --> 16:05.279
Leshui,

341
16:05.679 --> 16:06.399
what are you doing here?

342
16:06.399 --> 16:07.600
Weren't you told to stay inside?

343
16:08.200 --> 16:09.159
Haipeng, you're here too?

344
16:10.759 --> 16:11.679
You're all here.

345
16:13.799 --> 16:14.440
That's perfect.

346
16:14.879 --> 16:16.200
I got footage of someone from behind yesterday.

347
16:16.279 --> 16:17.840
Take a look and see who this is.

348
16:18.360 --> 16:18.879
From behind? Who is it?

349
16:19.200 --> 16:19.799
Whose figure?

350
16:19.840 --> 16:20.399
Let me see.

351
16:26.039 --> 16:27.000
It's too blurry.

352
16:30.440 --> 16:31.399
Right here, look.

353
16:36.960 --> 16:37.639
Excuse me.

354
16:38.600 --> 16:39.600
Coming through.

355
16:42.840 --> 16:43.320
Coming!

356
16:47.519 --> 16:47.919
Coming!

357
16:47.919 --> 16:48.559
Master Cheng,

358
16:49.039 --> 16:49.759
sorry to bother you.

359
16:55.600 --> 16:56.080
Anyone home?

360
16:56.600 --> 16:57.080
Who is it?

361
16:57.759 --> 16:58.320
Who?

362
16:58.480 --> 16:59.200
Nobody's here.

363
16:59.919 --> 17:00.519
Nobody.

364
17:00.840 --> 17:01.639
We're closed today.

365
17:04.240 --> 17:04.839
Closed today.

366
17:05.200 --> 17:06.279
I saw by your front door

367
17:06.279 --> 17:07.759
that there's a "closed" sign hanging.

368
17:20.839 --> 17:21.680
What are you all doing here?

369
17:22.279 --> 17:22.799
Just chatting.

370
17:23.519 --> 17:23.880
Come on out.

371
17:32.359 --> 17:33.119
Step outside.

372
17:34.200 --> 17:34.759
What are you afraid of?

373
17:35.880 --> 17:37.079
Things are pretty chaotic outside, aren't they?

374
17:37.759 --> 17:38.480
We're scared.

375
17:38.720 --> 17:39.200
Right.

376
17:41.279 --> 17:42.240
Reporter Shen is here too.

377
17:42.839 --> 17:43.279
What brings you here?

378
17:43.599 --> 17:44.200
Here for a drink?

379
17:45.000 --> 17:46.319
Are you here for a drink too, Officer Gao?

380
17:46.880 --> 17:47.480
Official business.

381
17:48.720 --> 17:49.200
What about you?

382
17:50.200 --> 17:51.359
Just catching up with an old friend.

383
17:52.519 --> 17:53.400
Chatting is fine.

384
17:54.039 --> 17:55.240
Just don't leak details about the case.

385
17:55.640 --> 17:56.559
We're running a police investigation.

386
17:56.559 --> 17:57.559
If you obstruct it,

387
17:57.559 --> 17:58.480
you'll be held liable.

388
18:00.160 --> 18:00.720
Of course not.

389
18:01.240 --> 18:01.759
Not at all.

390
18:03.480 --> 18:04.599
Just catching up with an old friend.

391
18:05.039 --> 18:05.640
Right, we're just...

392
18:05.640 --> 18:06.400
...just chatting.

393
18:07.359 --> 18:08.640
Would you mind giving us a moment?

394
18:11.680 --> 18:12.240
Sure.

395
18:13.319 --> 18:14.279
I'll take off then.

396
18:15.039 --> 18:15.680
Take care, everyone.

397
18:20.799 --> 18:21.279
Watch your step.

398
18:26.440 --> 18:28.319
Look at you, why aren't you wearing a hard hat?

399
18:28.680 --> 18:29.119
I'll walk her out.

400
18:29.200 --> 18:29.759
No need.

401
18:30.079 --> 18:30.640
In broad daylight?

402
18:30.640 --> 18:31.160
What's there to fear?

403
18:31.240 --> 18:31.920
She can walk on her own. I have to go...

404
18:31.920 --> 18:33.079
...pick up my grandson.

405
18:33.480 --> 18:34.160
What's the rush?

406
18:34.160 --> 18:34.559
No, no...

407
18:34.559 --> 18:35.119
Your grandson isn't in a rush.

408
18:35.119 --> 18:35.559
I am.

409
18:35.640 --> 18:36.160
Please have a seat.

410
18:36.200 --> 18:37.119
Come on, sit.

411
18:37.839 --> 18:38.640
Where are you going?

412
18:38.960 --> 18:39.559
To lock the door.

413
18:39.920 --> 18:40.400
Why lock the door?

414
18:40.400 --> 18:41.400
You've got the "Closed" sign up.

415
18:41.400 --> 18:41.839
No one's coming.

416
18:42.000 --> 18:42.319
Sit.

417
18:47.440 --> 18:48.359
Have a seat, come on.

418
19:01.599 --> 19:02.359
Just routine questioning.

419
19:03.000 --> 19:03.720
No need to be nervous.

420
19:05.279 --> 19:05.920
I'm not.

421
19:15.160 --> 19:17.279
When was the last time you saw Qian Yichuan?

422
19:18.599 --> 19:20.480
The day I was drinking here with him.

423
19:22.160 --> 19:23.480
The day after he got jumped,

424
19:24.440 --> 19:25.119
me,

425
19:26.039 --> 19:27.559
Haipeng, and Tieping—

426
19:27.759 --> 19:28.799
we went to the hospital to see him.

427
19:29.799 --> 19:31.680
Of course I had to visit him.

428
19:32.599 --> 19:34.000
We started at the brewery together.

429
19:34.000 --> 19:35.160
We were real close.

430
19:37.400 --> 19:38.720
At the hospital,

431
19:40.039 --> 19:40.759
he just kept cussing people out.

432
19:41.640 --> 19:42.160
Who was he cussing out?

433
19:43.039 --> 19:44.119
Ma Guowen, who else?

434
19:46.200 --> 19:47.279
Because of his leg.

435
19:47.720 --> 19:49.680
Ma Guowen hired guys to break it.

436
19:50.839 --> 19:52.839
Didn't that Leizi who beat him end up in prison?

437
19:53.680 --> 19:54.920
Anyway, he had a foul mouth.

438
19:55.079 --> 19:56.400
I couldn't stand him either way.

439
19:59.319 --> 20:01.039
Who else did he cuss out besides Ma Guowen?

440
20:03.680 --> 20:04.680
Liu Xuemei.

441
20:07.279 --> 20:08.480
He said Liu Xuemei was a traitor.

442
20:11.680 --> 20:12.680
It was all because of

443
20:13.359 --> 20:14.759
that auction mess.

444
20:17.799 --> 20:19.519
They all said Liu Xuemei was a traitor.

445
20:19.799 --> 20:20.640
They all hated her.

446
20:21.160 --> 20:21.759
Why?

447
20:22.480 --> 20:23.400
Back then, Liu Xuemei

448
20:23.400 --> 20:25.279
represented all of us at the auction.

449
20:25.839 --> 20:26.720
In the end, she ran off.

450
20:29.799 --> 20:31.400
Everyone was counting on her.

451
20:33.839 --> 20:34.680
For some reason,

452
20:34.680 --> 20:35.759
she got totally wasted.

453
20:36.519 --> 20:38.160
As a Beer Taster, she didn't usually drink off-duty.

454
20:40.240 --> 20:42.200
Who was she drinking with on the day of the auction?

455
20:43.039 --> 20:43.839
No idea.

456
20:44.440 --> 20:45.119
Don't know.

457
20:46.279 --> 20:46.920
I don't know.

458
20:47.359 --> 20:48.200
I really don't know.

459
20:57.440 --> 20:59.759
"North Street shop reopens after renovation,

460
20:59.920 --> 21:01.200
lines stretch down the block.

461
21:02.039 --> 21:02.640
Recently,

462
21:02.880 --> 21:04.559
our historic shop underwent..."

463
21:11.359 --> 21:11.880
Nurse,

464
21:12.599 --> 21:13.720
when will he wake up?

465
21:13.920 --> 21:15.799
It depends on how he recovers.

466
21:16.160 --> 21:17.720
It helps to talk to him more.

467
21:17.799 --> 21:19.119
Read him the newspaper or something.

468
21:19.400 --> 21:20.480
Just don't be too loud.

469
21:20.559 --> 21:21.519
Call me if you need anything.

470
21:22.039 --> 21:22.599
Thank you.

471
22:13.200 --> 22:14.599
I've watched Malt Kingdom so many times.

472
22:16.960 --> 22:18.759
Back when the workers pooled money to buy the factory,

473
22:19.559 --> 22:20.920
you filmed the whole process.

474
22:21.240 --> 22:22.920
Yet there isn't a single shot of it in the documentary.

475
22:26.960 --> 22:27.839
My guess is,

476
22:28.839 --> 22:30.400
Ma Guowen and the TV station back then

477
22:30.400 --> 22:31.599
put a lot of pressure on you.

478
22:34.400 --> 22:35.680
But you still have the raw footage.

479
22:37.920 --> 22:39.960
So I suggest you think back carefully

480
22:40.720 --> 22:42.440
to see if there are any clues pointing to the killer.

481
22:44.720 --> 22:46.039
It's been days already.

482
22:46.920 --> 22:48.319
You guys still haven't found any clues?

483
22:50.240 --> 22:50.920
Officer Gao.

484
22:51.440 --> 22:52.680
I was just about to ask you.

485
22:56.319 --> 22:57.559
"It's confidential,

486
22:57.839 --> 22:59.160
no comment," right?

487
23:02.240 --> 23:03.119
Fine.

488
23:03.359 --> 23:04.319
Let me tell you this.

489
23:05.480 --> 23:07.640
I'll definitely get to the bottom of this,

490
23:08.200 --> 23:09.839
whether it's the past or the present.

491
23:10.279 --> 23:11.200
Until I figure it out,

492
23:11.559 --> 23:12.759
I'm never leaving Lacheng.

493
23:16.920 --> 23:17.799
The bad guys...

494
23:18.960 --> 23:20.200
Not a single one will get away.

495
23:20.440 --> 23:22.039
Then give me a list of your suspects.

496
23:22.599 --> 23:23.440
Write them down.

497
23:23.880 --> 23:24.920
What's the point of just talking?

498
23:25.119 --> 23:26.519
Isn't shouting slogans just pure bullshit?

499
23:27.319 --> 23:28.519
Why are you getting so worked up?

500
23:29.240 --> 23:31.279
Why don't you go find the one who stole the tapes?

501
23:41.640 --> 23:42.000
Hello?

502
23:42.119 --> 23:42.920
Cut the act.

503
23:46.359 --> 23:47.039
I'll be right over.

504
23:53.599 --> 23:54.920
There are doctors and nurses here.

505
23:55.200 --> 23:56.640
He can't even open his mouth to speak.

506
23:56.759 --> 23:57.759
Please leave, reporter.

507
24:01.240 --> 24:01.680
Excuse me.

508
24:02.119 --> 24:02.559
Nurse.

509
24:02.920 --> 24:03.799
Check on bed 19.

510
24:04.880 --> 24:05.839
Quite the actor.

511
24:06.680 --> 24:08.039
You're the one who stole the tapes, aren't you?

512
24:29.880 --> 24:30.519
You're awake.

513
24:34.079 --> 24:34.920
How are you feeling?

514
24:36.400 --> 24:36.880
Don't be scared.

515
24:36.880 --> 24:37.920
You're safe now.

516
24:45.279 --> 24:46.400
Just a mild concussion,

517
24:47.000 --> 24:48.759
but your arms and legs are fine.

518
24:49.119 --> 24:50.880
Once you recover, you'll be back to normal.

519
25:01.000 --> 25:01.920
Where's Qian Yichuan?

520
25:16.640 --> 25:17.519
Tell me,

521
25:18.799 --> 25:21.000
back when I caught Ma Guowen cooking the books,

522
25:21.440 --> 25:22.880
if I hadn't exposed him

523
25:25.640 --> 25:27.119
and led everyone to buy the factory,

524
25:29.720 --> 25:31.000
would things have been different?

525
25:35.799 --> 25:36.640
What's with you?

526
25:38.720 --> 25:39.680
Regretting it?

527
25:47.960 --> 25:48.920
It's all the same, really.

528
25:50.799 --> 25:51.759
It's just that...

529
25:55.079 --> 25:56.519
you might have...

530
26:11.279 --> 26:12.240
Don't be sad.

531
26:13.240 --> 26:14.119
Get some rest.

532
26:27.599 --> 26:28.440
It's standard procedure.

533
26:28.960 --> 26:30.200
We might need to record this.

534
26:30.599 --> 26:31.359
Do you agree to that?

535
26:37.480 --> 26:38.759
Think back carefully.

536
26:39.240 --> 26:40.799
What really happened that night?

537
26:43.039 --> 26:44.480
We were originally thinking,

538
26:44.880 --> 26:46.480
before leaving the factory,

539
26:46.960 --> 26:48.400
to go check out the top of the malt silo.

540
26:50.079 --> 26:53.440
But Old Qian said he wanted to talk to Shen Leshui.

541
26:54.240 --> 26:56.680
So he used my phone to call her,

542
26:57.799 --> 26:59.799
asking to meet at the abandoned plant gate.

543
27:02.319 --> 27:03.480
While waiting for her,

544
27:04.440 --> 27:05.640
the two of us went up to the silo top.

545
27:06.359 --> 27:07.519
Not long after,

546
27:09.039 --> 27:09.839
all of a sudden,

547
27:11.279 --> 27:13.680
I felt someone hit me from behind,

548
27:15.400 --> 27:16.319
and I blacked out.

549
27:18.559 --> 27:20.400
What did Qian Yichuan want to say to Shen Leshui?

550
27:21.960 --> 27:22.799
I don't know.

551
27:23.359 --> 27:24.400
He didn't tell me.

552
27:28.279 --> 27:29.799
What time was the call made?

553
27:30.279 --> 27:32.039
What time did you two go up?

554
27:33.359 --> 27:33.799
And also,

555
27:33.799 --> 27:36.079
how long after going up did you hear someone come?

556
27:37.720 --> 27:38.200
Take your time.

557
27:38.240 --> 27:39.079
Go through them one by one.

558
27:39.400 --> 27:41.720
I know you're dizzy and feeling awful,

559
27:42.240 --> 27:43.279
but these details

560
27:43.279 --> 27:45.200
are crucial to solving the case.

561
27:49.319 --> 27:50.599
I remember this clearly.

562
27:53.880 --> 27:55.720
The call was made around six thirty.

563
27:56.279 --> 27:57.759
We went up to the silo top at seven.

564
27:58.759 --> 28:01.079
I even specifically checked my watch.

565
28:03.319 --> 28:05.400
You didn't see what they looked like at all?

566
28:07.839 --> 28:08.599
No.

567
28:13.279 --> 28:14.160
What about Qian Yichuan?

568
28:14.960 --> 28:17.279
Didn't he shout out a name or anything?

569
28:18.839 --> 28:19.319
No.

570
28:20.079 --> 28:22.440
After I fell, I had no idea what happened.

571
28:25.799 --> 28:27.079
From Ma Guowen,

572
28:27.759 --> 28:28.680
to Cao Jun,

573
28:31.720 --> 28:32.759
and now Old Qian...

574
28:34.039 --> 28:36.039
I never thought death would be this close to me.

575
28:37.680 --> 28:38.960
Who is this person?

576
28:40.279 --> 28:41.720
Why does he want to kill us?

577
28:45.640 --> 28:47.680
The killer probably didn't intend to kill you.

578
28:49.079 --> 28:50.839
Otherwise, you'd have ended up just like Old Qian.

579
28:53.960 --> 28:56.240
Did Old Qian have bad blood

580
28:56.279 --> 28:57.559
with anyone at the plant?

581
28:58.640 --> 29:00.799
Like something festering for over ten years?

582
29:02.839 --> 29:04.920
Festering for over ten years?

583
29:05.519 --> 29:07.200
That would have to be Ma Guowen.

584
29:08.240 --> 29:10.000
But isn't Ma Guowen already dead?

585
29:12.640 --> 29:14.680
I'm not afraid to tell you guys now.

586
29:16.880 --> 29:18.400
Right after Ma Guowen died,

587
29:19.160 --> 29:20.880
I actually suspected Old Qian did it.

588
29:22.759 --> 29:25.319
If Qian Yichuan killed Ma Guowen,

589
29:26.359 --> 29:29.559
then who killed him and Cao Jun?

590
29:33.680 --> 29:35.720
Did he clash with anyone recently?

591
29:36.359 --> 29:38.119
Tons of people clashed with him.

592
29:39.640 --> 29:40.960
With that foul mouth of his,

593
29:42.319 --> 29:43.559
he'd chew out anyone he saw.

594
29:44.359 --> 29:46.039
I bet everyone had problems with him.

595
29:49.839 --> 29:51.279
There's someone else who had a major grudge.

596
29:52.960 --> 29:53.680
Who?

597
29:55.119 --> 29:55.759
Leizi.

598
30:05.000 --> 30:06.319
Are you Lei Zhenqiang?

599
30:06.880 --> 30:07.920
Yes, he's Lei Zhenqiang.

600
30:08.920 --> 30:10.279
People used to call him Leizi.

601
30:10.480 --> 30:11.839
Yeah, everyone used to call him Leizi.

602
30:13.960 --> 30:15.039
How many years has he been like this?

603
30:15.799 --> 30:18.000
He came down with it about seven or eight years ago.

604
30:18.839 --> 30:19.400
A brain hemorrhage.

605
30:20.319 --> 30:20.799
These are the aftereffects.

606
30:25.559 --> 30:26.519
Come on, brother, Lei.

607
30:27.160 --> 30:28.799
You're not as cocky as you used to be, huh?

608
30:31.359 --> 30:32.720
Still, in the end, someone's gotta wait on you.

609
30:34.440 --> 30:35.319
Want to get out of bed?

610
30:35.559 --> 30:36.359
Take a couple of steps?

611
30:43.599 --> 30:44.160
Come in.

612
30:47.319 --> 30:48.079
Officer.

613
30:49.160 --> 30:49.799
I...

614
30:50.039 --> 30:50.720
wanted to ask...

615
30:51.039 --> 30:51.759
about...

616
30:52.400 --> 30:53.960
that incident where the brewery sculpture was hit.

617
30:54.480 --> 30:55.640
You're from the brewery?

618
30:57.839 --> 30:59.079
The driver already admitted to it.

619
30:59.480 --> 31:01.319
We've already issued an administrative penalty.

620
31:02.039 --> 31:02.640
As for...

621
31:02.640 --> 31:03.759
that sculpture of yours,

622
31:03.960 --> 31:05.200
it falls under civil compensation.

623
31:05.480 --> 31:06.759
You'll have to file a civil lawsuit.

624
31:11.240 --> 31:12.119
Who hit it?

625
31:13.000 --> 31:13.799
Chen Qingchun.

626
31:14.039 --> 31:15.759
A retiree from your brewery.

627
31:16.400 --> 31:17.640
You have his contact info, right?

628
31:18.200 --> 31:18.640
Yeah.

629
31:19.039 --> 31:20.000
Then I don't need to give it to you.

630
31:20.079 --> 31:20.480
Off you go.

631
31:23.240 --> 31:23.960
Anything else?

632
31:24.799 --> 31:25.200
Nope.

633
31:25.599 --> 31:26.240
Then head on out.

634
31:26.400 --> 31:27.000
Close the door behind you.

635
31:30.759 --> 31:31.400
Go on.

636
32:00.759 --> 32:01.519
Let go!

637
32:02.359 --> 32:03.440
Let go of me!

638
32:21.720 --> 32:22.480
It's all your fault.

639
32:24.880 --> 32:26.079
Why did you even come back?

640
32:27.440 --> 32:28.960
Nothing good ever happens when you're back.

641
32:29.559 --> 32:32.720
You hauled that beat-up camera around, shooting everywhere.

642
32:33.240 --> 32:34.400
Where's all the stuff you shot?

643
32:35.279 --> 32:36.599
Why didn't you just show it?

644
32:36.920 --> 32:38.880
If you had, none of this would've happened!

645
33:04.680 --> 33:06.599
Where were you when Qian Yichuan was looking for you?

646
33:08.759 --> 33:10.240
You were nowhere to be found!

647
33:11.839 --> 33:13.519
When someone needs you, you disappear.

648
33:13.960 --> 33:16.079
When nobody wants you, you scurry all over!

649
33:16.240 --> 33:17.599
Showing up everywhere!

650
33:21.519 --> 33:23.359
What kind of scumbag are you?

651
33:23.960 --> 33:25.519
Why did you come back to torment us?

652
33:25.559 --> 33:27.119
Why torment us?!

653
33:42.079 --> 33:43.039
Don't sit there.

654
33:43.240 --> 33:43.799
It's cold.

655
33:46.240 --> 33:47.160
Let's talk inside.

656
33:47.839 --> 33:48.400
All right?

657
33:54.640 --> 33:55.200
Come on.

658
34:17.440 --> 34:17.760
Here.

659
34:18.800 --> 34:19.599
Eat something warm.

660
34:29.840 --> 34:30.880
We're not done yet.

661
34:31.639 --> 34:32.800
Don't think buying me food

662
34:32.800 --> 34:33.880
will shut me up.

663
34:35.320 --> 34:36.039
Fine.

664
34:37.239 --> 34:38.800
We live close to each other anyway.

665
34:39.159 --> 34:40.119
Whenever you want to yell at me,

666
34:40.159 --> 34:40.960
just knock on my door.

667
34:46.079 --> 34:47.079
I'm too tired to curse right now.

668
34:48.159 --> 34:49.239
Let me catch my breath first.

669
34:55.039 --> 34:55.760
There's something...

670
34:56.639 --> 34:57.519
I still think

671
34:58.480 --> 34:59.719
it's safer to tell you.

672
35:01.000 --> 35:02.440
I bet before Qian Yichuan passed away,

673
35:02.519 --> 35:03.599
he wanted to tell you about this, too.

674
35:05.039 --> 35:05.679
What is it?

675
35:06.760 --> 35:07.639
It's about Liu Xuemei.

676
35:10.840 --> 35:12.039
I haven't been sleeping well lately.

677
35:13.480 --> 35:14.440
Every time I close my eyes,

678
35:15.599 --> 35:16.519
I see her face.

679
35:21.039 --> 35:22.719
When I go through the discarded footage,

680
35:23.320 --> 35:24.360
I often see her, too.

681
35:30.199 --> 35:31.000
You know how she was.

682
35:31.159 --> 35:32.639
She hadn't been at the plant long,

683
35:33.760 --> 35:34.920
but she made quite a name for herself.

684
35:37.199 --> 35:38.679
Lots of guys in the factory had eyes for her,

685
35:39.800 --> 35:40.920
but none of them were good enough for her.

686
35:42.519 --> 35:43.880
I think she definitely had someone on the side.

687
35:45.639 --> 35:46.719
How do you know?

688
35:47.880 --> 35:49.760
She went to the phone booth every day to make calls.

689
35:51.199 --> 35:52.599
As a Beer Taster,

690
35:53.039 --> 35:53.960
she couldn't even drink alcohol.

691
35:54.800 --> 35:56.360
Yet every time she got off the phone,

692
35:56.880 --> 35:58.000
her cheeks were flushed,

693
35:58.079 --> 35:58.880
looking radiant as ever.

694
36:01.719 --> 36:04.199
You think she was calling a lover?

695
36:04.440 --> 36:05.880
Whether it was a lover, I don't know.

696
36:06.679 --> 36:07.840
But looking at her eyes,

697
36:07.840 --> 36:09.159
she was definitely calling a man.

698
36:10.599 --> 36:11.480
Who was that guy?

699
36:13.239 --> 36:14.920
I'm not a cop, how would I know?

700
36:18.480 --> 36:20.119
But I heard the calls were to Qingzhou.

701
36:22.039 --> 36:22.719
Qingzhou?

702
36:23.559 --> 36:25.079
I took a cab here from Qingzhou.

703
37:37.840 --> 37:38.400
Haipeng.

704
37:39.039 --> 37:39.960
Are you free right now?

705
37:41.400 --> 37:42.320
Well, strictly speaking...

706
37:42.400 --> 37:43.039
Of course I am.

707
37:43.559 --> 37:44.199
Back then,

708
37:44.800 --> 37:46.599
to welcome the millennium,

709
37:46.840 --> 37:49.679
they held a province-wide contest with prizes.

710
37:52.119 --> 37:52.519
Look.

711
37:53.159 --> 37:54.079
I told you so.

712
37:55.280 --> 37:56.239
Hold on, let me take a look.

713
37:57.280 --> 37:58.119
There's no name on it.

714
37:58.440 --> 37:59.679
Look, it just says "Qingzhou."

715
38:03.559 --> 38:04.159
Qingzhou?

716
38:05.719 --> 38:06.239
Hey,

717
38:06.679 --> 38:08.599
do you think the submitter

718
38:08.800 --> 38:10.119
was Liu Xuemei's lover?

719
38:11.880 --> 38:13.360
To paint her on a beer label,

720
38:13.559 --> 38:14.760
and make it look so beautiful...

721
38:15.400 --> 38:16.320
It's very likely.

722
38:18.960 --> 38:20.559
This lover was from Qingzhou.

723
38:22.159 --> 38:24.599
Gao Xuelin's father, Gao Wusong,

724
38:24.800 --> 38:26.079
was from Qingzhou, too.

725
38:27.960 --> 38:29.880
Could there have been

726
38:30.320 --> 38:32.079
a romantic relationship between them?

727
38:35.280 --> 38:37.440
Then Gao Xuelin's connection to this case

728
38:37.960 --> 38:38.880
becomes clear.

729
38:40.719 --> 38:42.079
Could it really be that coincidental?

730
38:43.599 --> 38:44.599
It's no coincidence.

731
38:45.480 --> 38:47.199
Gao Xuelin is the one

732
38:47.440 --> 38:48.559
who stitched all this together.

733
38:51.840 --> 38:54.519
Regardless of whether Gao Wusong painted it,

734
38:54.880 --> 38:55.239
hey,

735
38:55.719 --> 38:57.199
don't you think it's kind of romantic?

736
38:58.840 --> 39:00.599
Romance is a fleeting feeling,

737
39:01.320 --> 39:02.800
and feelings don't last.

738
39:03.599 --> 39:05.280
Then why did you get divorced back then?

739
39:07.559 --> 39:08.400
What are you talking about?

740
39:08.840 --> 39:09.599
Where are your manners?

741
39:14.639 --> 39:15.920
My ex-husband is a good man.

742
39:17.159 --> 39:17.960
It was my fault.

743
39:20.559 --> 39:21.920
His current wife

744
39:22.559 --> 39:23.519
is really nice, too.

745
39:26.119 --> 39:26.679
I just hope

746
39:28.400 --> 39:29.760
good things happen to good people.

747
39:33.480 --> 39:34.840
Why am I telling you this?

748
39:38.559 --> 39:39.559
Look, we've come this far.

749
39:39.840 --> 39:40.760
Couldn't we...

750
39:41.079 --> 39:42.360
leave out Gao Xuelin's name for now

751
39:42.360 --> 39:43.320
and publish part of it first?

752
39:44.880 --> 39:45.800
Remember this:

753
39:46.440 --> 39:47.480
with this case,

754
39:47.719 --> 39:48.840
we can't rush.

755
39:49.480 --> 39:51.679
Right now, we're only at the suspicion stage.

756
39:52.079 --> 39:53.559
What if we have no solid evidence?

757
39:53.719 --> 39:55.559
Just take things out of context and distort facts?

758
39:55.559 --> 39:57.679
But in journalism, every second counts.

759
39:57.880 --> 39:59.800
If we're late, we'll just be eating their dust.

760
40:00.679 --> 40:02.440
We move when we have enough evidence.

761
40:02.840 --> 40:04.079
Now is not the time.

762
40:36.280 --> 40:37.039
Liu Xiaosheng?

763
40:39.840 --> 40:40.480
That's me.

764
40:41.000 --> 40:41.920
And you are?

765
40:42.000 --> 40:42.599
Hello.

766
40:42.960 --> 40:43.920
I'm Shen Leshui.

767
40:44.760 --> 40:46.480
I made the documentary *Malt Kingdom*.

768
40:47.119 --> 40:48.480
I interviewed your mother back then.

769
40:49.679 --> 40:50.880
I called you yesterday,

770
40:51.400 --> 40:52.079
but you didn't answer.

771
40:53.519 --> 40:53.920
Right.

772
40:56.840 --> 40:57.920
May I sit here?

773
41:04.400 --> 41:05.360
What is this about?

774
41:05.880 --> 41:06.719
My shuttle is coming soon.

775
41:09.159 --> 41:11.159
The recent murder at the old Lapi Brewery...

776
41:12.199 --> 41:13.000
Have you heard about it?

777
41:14.800 --> 41:15.400
Haven't paid attention.

778
41:20.280 --> 41:21.000
I wanted to

779
41:23.000 --> 41:24.119
ask about your mother.

780
41:29.119 --> 41:29.800
I heard

781
41:30.519 --> 41:31.840
that before she died,

782
41:31.960 --> 41:33.079
she took a trip to Qingzhou.

783
41:34.079 --> 41:35.320
Do you know why?

784
41:37.440 --> 41:38.400
I was only eight back then.

785
41:39.119 --> 41:39.800
Where she went,

786
41:40.679 --> 41:41.400
I really don't know.

787
41:43.440 --> 41:45.400
Did anyone in your family

788
41:45.960 --> 41:47.320
ever ask about the autopsy?

789
41:49.360 --> 41:50.320
The grown-ups might have.

790
41:51.079 --> 41:51.840
I don't remember.

791
41:55.199 --> 41:57.519
December 31st, 1999.

792
41:57.960 --> 41:59.800
It snowed heavily that day.

793
42:00.159 --> 42:01.360
Your mother went to attend a—

794
42:01.360 --> 42:02.119
I don't have

795
42:02.119 --> 42:03.079
any good feelings towards the people at Lapi Brewery.

796
42:03.840 --> 42:04.559
After what happened,

797
42:04.880 --> 42:06.320
they were all badmouthing my mom.

798
42:07.400 --> 42:08.480
The things they said

799
42:09.119 --> 42:10.559
were as nasty as could be.

800
42:12.280 --> 42:13.599
I was just a seven or eight-year-old kid.

801
42:14.440 --> 42:15.159
I didn't understand

802
42:15.159 --> 42:16.519
why people cursed my mom like that.

803
42:17.400 --> 42:18.280
I didn't want to hear it,

804
42:18.880 --> 42:19.760
so I fought them.

805
42:21.199 --> 42:22.239
But I couldn't beat them.

806
42:24.039 --> 42:24.639
Later,

807
42:25.280 --> 42:26.639
I was sent to my grandma's.

808
42:27.800 --> 42:28.840
These past dozen years,

809
42:29.400 --> 42:30.280
I've been doing fine.

810
42:31.400 --> 42:31.920
But if you

811
42:31.920 --> 42:33.519
insist on asking me about the brewery...

812
42:35.360 --> 42:36.039
I know nothing.

813
42:36.079 --> 42:36.719
Sorry.

814
42:37.559 --> 42:38.360
I have to catch my shuttle.

815
42:39.800 --> 42:41.599
I... I just have one more question.

816
42:43.639 --> 42:45.159
Do you know Gao Wusong?

817
42:46.239 --> 42:48.199
He's a cab driver in Qingzhou.

818
42:50.960 --> 42:51.599
Don't know him.

819
43:03.400 --> 43:05.440
Gao Xuelin's father

820
43:05.519 --> 43:08.719
was Liu Xuemei's lover in Qingzhou.

821
43:09.360 --> 43:10.280
So are you saying

822
43:11.039 --> 43:12.400
that cop named Gao

823
43:12.840 --> 43:14.280
stole the tape for his father?

824
43:15.400 --> 43:16.400
Not just the tape.

825
43:16.920 --> 43:18.199
He probably committed murder, too.

826
43:22.039 --> 43:23.679
He should be under investigation right now, right?

827
43:24.519 --> 43:25.360
Just now,

828
43:26.519 --> 43:27.360
I checked your public account,

829
43:27.920 --> 43:29.400
and it says "murderer."
